      "text": "Now, we need to multiply 86 by 60 (the tens digit of 68, which is 6 multiplied by 10):\n```\n  86\n\u00d7 60\n-----\n 5160\n```\nWe place this result below the previous one, aligning the digits by their place values:\n```\n  86\n\u00d7 68\n-----\n 5160\n 688\n-----\n 5878\n```\nAdding these two results together (5160 + 688) gives us the final product:\n```\n  5160\n+  688\n-----\n  5878\n```\nTherefore, the product of 86 and 68 is 5878.\n</answer>",
