  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Now, we need to multiply 53 by 20 (the tens digit of 24, which is 2 multiplied by 10). To do this, we can simply add a zero to the end of the result we got from multiplying 53 by 4:\n```\n  53\n\u00d7 20\n-----\n 1060\n```\nNow, we add the two results together:\n```\n  212\n+1060\n-----\n 1072\n```\nTherefore, the product of 53 and 24 is 1072.\n</answer>",
