  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Now, we need to multiply 43 by 80 (the tens digit of 88, which is 8 with a zero added at the end):\n```\n  43\n\u00d7 80\n-----\n 3440\n```\nNext, we add the two results together:\n```\n  344\n+3440\n-----\n 3784\n```\nTherefore, the product of 43 and 88 is 3784, not 3782 as you initially thought.\n</\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>\n</answer>",
