      "text": "Now, we need to multiply 92 by 40 (the tens digit of 47, which is 4 multiplied by 10):\n```\n  92\n\u00d7 40\n-----\n 3680\n```\nWe'll place this result below the previous one, aligning the digits by their place values:\n```\n  92\n\u00d7 47\n-----\n 3680\n 644\n-----\n```\nNow, we add the two results together:\n```\n  3680\n+ 644\n-----\n 4323\n```\nTherefore, the product of 92 and 47 is 4323.\n</answer>",
