  "model": "Qwen2.5-3B-SFT-GRPO-200",
  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Now, let's calculate each part separately:\n\\[ 99 \\times 30 = 99 \\times (3 \\times 10) = (99 \\times 3) \\times 10 \\]\n\\[ 99 \\times 3 = 297 \\]\nSo,\n\\[ 99 \\times 30 = 297 \\times 10 = 2970 \\]\nNext, we calculate:\n\\[ 99 \\times 1 = 99 \\]\nNow, we add the two results together:\n\\[ 2970 + 99 = 3069 \\]\nTherefore, the product of 99 and 31 is:\n\\[ 99 \\times 31 = 3069 \\]\nThe correct answer is: 3069.\n</answer>",
