      "index": 0,
      "text": "For the first part, we calculate:\n```\n88 \u00d7 5 = 440\n```\nFor the second part, we calculate:\n```\n88 \u00d7 90 = 88 \u00d7 (9 \u00d7 10) = (88 \u00d7 9) \u00d7 10\n```\nNow, let's find 88 \u00d7 9:\n```\n88 \u00d7 9 = (80 + 8) \u00d7 9 = (80 \u00d7 9) + (8 \u00d7 9) = 720 + 72 = 792\n```\nSo,\n```\n88 \u00d7 90 = 792 \u00d7 10 = 7920\n```\nNow, we add the two results together:\n```\n440 + 7920 = 8360\n```\nTherefore, the product of 88 and 95 is 8360.\n</answer>",
