  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Now, let's calculate each part separately:\n\\[ 100 \\times 18 = 1800 \\]\n\\[ 1 \\times 18 = 18 \\]\nSubtract the second result from the first:\n\\[ 1800 - 18 = 1782 \\]\nTherefore, the product of 99 and 18 is:\n\\[ 99 \\times 18 = 1782 \\]\nSo, the correct answer is: 1782.\n</answer>",
