  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Now, we need to multiply 54 by 30 (the tens digit of 39, which is 3 with a zero added at the end):\n```\n  54\n\u00d7 30\n-----\n 1620\n```\nTo get the final product, we add the two results together:\n```\n  486\n+1620\n-----\n 2106\n```\nTherefore, the product of 54 and 39 is 2106, not 1106 as you initially thought.\n</\uff5cAssistant\uff5c>\n</answer>",
