messages:  ['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 50 and 74? Please reason step by step.I think the correct answer is: 3704\n\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the product of 50 and 74, we can follow these steps:\n1. Understand that the product of two numbers is the result of multiplying them together.\n2. Recognize that 50 and 74 are both two-digit numbers, which means we will need to use the standard multiplication algorithm.\n3. Set up the multiplication problem as follows:\n   50\n× 74\n4. Multiply 50 by 4 (the ones digit of 74):\n   50\n× 74\n   200\n5. Multiply 50 by 70 (the tens digit of 74, which is 7 times 10):\n   50\n× 74\n   200\n  3500\n6. Add the two results together:\n   50\n× 74\n   200\n+ 3500\n   3700\nTherefore, the product of 50 and 74 is 3700.\n</think>\n<answer>\nThe product of 50 and 74 is 3700.\n</answer>\n']
