  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Now, let's move to the second step:\n```\n   38\n\u00d7   0\n------\n    0\n```\nSince we are multiplying by 0, the result is 0. Adding this to the result of the first step:\n```\n  342\n+   0\n------\n  342\n```\nTherefore, the product of 38 and 90 is 342. The correct answer is not 3427, but 342.\n</answer>",
