messages:  ["Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the Product of 64 and 17? Please reason step by step.I think the correct answer is: 4088\n\n<think>\nTo solve the problem of finding the product of 64 and 17, we can use the standard multiplication method. This involves multiplying each digit of one number by each digit of the other number and then adding the results. Let's break it down step by step.\n...\n</think>\n<answer>\nFirst, let's write the numbers one above the other for clarity:\n```\n  64\n× 17\n```\nWe can break this into two parts: multiplying 64 by 7, and then multiplying 64 by 10 (which is just adding a zero to 64).\n1. Multiplying 64 by 7:\n```\n  64\n×  7\n-----\n 448\n```\n2. Multiplying 64 by 10:\n```\n  64\n× 10\n-----\n 640\n```\n"]
