      "text": "Now, we need to multiply 35 by 60 (the tens digit of 69, which is 6 with a zero added at the end):\n```\n  35\n\u00d7 60\n-----\n 2100\n```\nNext, we add the two results together:\n```\n  315\n+2100\n-----\n 2415\n```\nTherefore, the product of 35 and 69 is 2415. The initial answer of 2615 is incorrect.\n</answer>",
