  "object": "text_completion",
  "created": 1753522453,
  "model": "Qwen2.5-3B-SFT-GRPO-200",
  "choices": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Now, we need to multiply 32 by 50 (the tens digit of 54, which is 5 with a zero added at the end):\n```\n  32\n\u00d7 50\n-----\n 1600\n```\nTo get this, we can think of it as multiplying 32 by 5 and then adding a zero at the end:\n```\n  32\n\u00d7  5\n-----\n 160\n```\nThen we add this result to the previous one:\n```\n  128\n+1600\n-----\n1728\n```\nTherefore, the product of 32 and 54 is 1728, not 1428 as you initially thought.\n</answer>",
      "logprobs": null,
      "finish_reason": "stop",
      "stop_reason": 151643,
      "prompt_logprobs": null
    }
